{"unit_id":"wellcover__dsh-conversation-stats#feature-1","repo":"wellcover/dsh-conversation-stats","commit":"506b82dfd1d4574e96e252569cf6928bda001055","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation-stats 的功能「会话统计总览」：在网页标签中列出会话轮数、步数、模型调用、token 用量和活跃时间，并汇总全体会话数据。页面定时刷新，也可手动重扫。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:142-209","lib/client.js:376-410"]}
{"unit_id":"wellcover__dsh-conversation-stats#feature-2","repo":"wellcover/dsh-conversation-stats","commit":"506b82dfd1d4574e96e252569cf6928bda001055","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation-stats 的功能「调用明细」：点击会话后查看模型与结束原因分布、工具耗时和失败数，以及逐条模型调用的时间、token 和工具信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:209-276","lib/index.js:416-440"]}
{"unit_id":"wellcover__dsh-conversation-stats#feature-3","repo":"wellcover/dsh-conversation-stats","commit":"506b82dfd1d4574e96e252569cf6928bda001055","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation-stats 的功能「管理会话」：用户可确认后删除会话日志目录，也可从归档列表恢复会话；恢复后需重启 DSH Web 才会显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:327-363","lib/index.js:445-478"]}
{"unit_id":"wellcover__dsh-conversation-stats#caveat-1","repo":"wellcover/dsh-conversation-stats","commit":"506b82dfd1d4574e96e252569cf6928bda001055","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation-stats 使用前须知：统计读取本机 $DSH_HOME/sessions 中的压缩会话日志；删除会移除对应会话目录，且不可恢复。（见 lib/index.js:324-345、445-452）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:324-345","lib/index.js:445-452"]}
{"unit_id":"wellcover__dsh-conversation-stats#card-zh","repo":"wellcover/dsh-conversation-stats","commit":"506b82dfd1d4574e96e252569cf6928bda001055","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation-stats 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话统计插件，在对话页面增加「会话统计」标签，并通过宿主接口读取本机保存的会话日志。它汇总会话轮数、步骤、模型调用、输入输出及缓存 token、工具耗时和模型分布；用户可查看逐条调用详情，手动或定时刷新统计，也可删除会话或恢复归档会话。适合需要核对历史对话用量、调用情况和会话状态的 DSH Web 用户。使用时从本机 DSH 数据目录读取记录；默认无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:324-408","lib/index.js:416-478","lib/client.js:280-354","lib/client.js:443-450"]}
{"unit_id":"wellcover__dsh-conversation-stats#card-en","repo":"wellcover/dsh-conversation-stats","commit":"506b82dfd1d4574e96e252569cf6928bda001055","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-conversation-stats adds a statistics tab to DSH Web using local session logs. It summarizes turns, model and tool calls, token usage, and timing, with per-call details. Users can refresh results, delete sessions, or restore archived ones. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:324-408","lib/index.js:416-478","lib/client.js:280-354","lib/client.js:443-450"]}
